  "title": "Alpha Tau Completes Patient Enrollment in its U.S. Pivotal Skin Cancer Study, Advancing Towards Goal of FDA Approval of Alpha DaRT® to Treat Recurrent Cutaneous Squamous Cell Carcinoma",
